    "hypothesis": "The PHYSICALLY_VALIDATED check analytic_rigid_box_modal_spectrum recorded UNKNOWN because record-based peak detection resolved only 3-4 of 12 analytic mode clusters (250 ms record gives ~4 Hz resolution and degenerate box modes cluster inside it; source/receiver nodal planes kill others). The independent check must therefore compare the discrete Neumann-operator spectrum itself against analytic rigid-box modes \u2014 detection-resolution artifacts are not operator error.",
